  "answer": "This feature has been requested before. PowerToys#47 is the main ticket, titled \"Minimize to tray by right clicking the minimize button\", and duplicates such as #36602 were closed in favour of it. The feature is not implemented yet. Add your use case and a thumbs-up to #47 rather than opening a new ticket. In the meantime, use a third-party tool. The tickets mention RBTray (the maintained fork at github.com/[user]/rbtray), the AutoHotkey script Min2Tray, Traymond, and 4t Tray Minimizer. Note that RBTray doesn't work with every app. One commenter reported that it fails with Opera."
